            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "John A\nDai Lanh, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGood experience\nDec 2020\nWe have been twice now and enjoyed the food and the wine very much and will be going again. One criticism, on both occasions the food for both myself and my wife did not get served at the same time. Yesterday, mine came and 20 minutes later my wife came. Please tell your staff to serve food at the same time, then the experience will be 5 star,s not 4.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2020",
