            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Linh Ấn\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nNot too good.\nDec 2018 • Couples\nHere they have a really good Ceasar salad.\nThe signature pizza is full of tomato sauce whatever your topping is, seafood or anything. I really like cheese, this pizza has a lot of cheese but too much tomato that I can't eat it all.\nWe have to wait a long time for our pizza. And even when the pizza is ready, staffs, which they are not too busy, didn't come to take the food to the table!\nThe same scenario occurs when we checked out. Without being busy, the staffs seem to be frustrated not doing a check for us.\nThe food is not too delicious and service is not good. I tried and won't come back again.\nThanks.\nRead more\nWritten December 3, 2018",
