            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nSatisfying for cheese lovers but long wait\nDec 2016 • Friends\nThey're most well known for their satisfyingly cheese-stuffed pizza and that's what we had. And because they have such a thick layer of pizza inside and they'll only start \"cooking\" after receiving your order, you'll only get your pizza after 30 minutes upon ordering. But it's worth the wait. If you love oozing, melty, slinky, stretchy cheese, come taste this.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 3, 2017",
