            "review_text": "Gibbinsp\n184 contributions\n0\nTrying something different\nAug 2017 • Family\nAfter getting back into town late, we tried a restaurant in a shopping centre. To say we were disappointed is an understatement:\n1. The meals came out cold\n2. We were to be changed 4000 VND for hand wipes when we're not provided with serviettes in the first place!\n3. Our beers were Luke warm at best. \n4. We were advised that the ice in the drinks was safe but will wait and see!!!\n5. The table is a setting for 6 but with 5 of us the table was quite crowded. \n\nThere are better options around.\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2017",
