            "review_text": "Phương M\nVietnam183 contributions\n0\nNot worth coming back for\nMay 2017 • Business\nWent as a big group yesterday so we almost tried every signature dish of this place. Every dish was so so. Just like any other half-Western restaurants in Vietnam, they poured the sauce all over the steak and regardless the fact that we order it well-done, steak still comes out very rare... Ribs are not well marinated. Pasta, however, seemed to be the best option so far for this place. Service is quick and nice.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 19, 2017",
