            "review_title": "Review at Cowboy Jack's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Karno N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam385 contributions\n0\nThe best Pizzas and Pastas in HCMC !\nSep 2016 • Family\nThis is a new restaurant on the 5th floor in the newly opened Saigon Center.\n\nIf you have a craving for Chicago Style thickly mozzarella cheese pizza; this place is for you! \n\nI visited it today which is a Saturday with friends and family and the place was packed during lunch but the wait was about 10 minutes and the view was awesome, too were the services.\n\nDrinks are ranges from typical sodas to cocktails. So choose your poisons 😉\n\nFoods; it has the pizza, pasta, steak, ribs, and sausages on the menu.\n\nWe had the Ham & Cheese and Seafoods Pizzas, BBQ Ribs, Seafoods Pasta and Honey Chicken Wings, and two fancy sodas. The pizza was awesome and stringy with thick mozzarella cheese. For 4 adults we barely finished the two that we ordered. They were good. The Pastas was also delicious as the sauce was just perfect and zesty. Not too salty or too sour..just perfect. The ribs were on the dried side and not as juicy as expected, but the BBQ sauce has a zangy taste to it which was surprisingly nice. The wings were alright and not worth mentioning.\n\nSo, I would recommend the Pizzas and the Pastas as the safest bet! 🤔\n\nWith the above we spent about $1,400,000 vnd which is about $64 usd! And half the seafoods pizza was taken home! 😃\n\nWell, I hope y'all will stop by and try the pizza whe y'all have a chance. \n\nEnjoy and happy traveling 🤗\n\nK\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 17, 2016",
