            "review_text": "bboykingtrack\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam47 contributions\n0\nNormal food, bad service\nJul 2016 • Family\nI visit it at Takashimaya Ho Chi Minh City and experienced bad service. The food quality was normal, nothing special and the price was very high if you compare with other available option at Takashimaya. The space is small, not as good as Cowboy jack's Vo Van Tan. The service is slow but it is acceptable because of huge load of customers. However, the service person wrote the wrong food that I ordered. Then they gave me a Honey Grilled Chicken and told me that is my Beefsteak. The restaurant manager couldn't tell whether it was Honey Grilled Chicken or Beefsteak. I asked them to check with the kitchen twice and it was Honey Grill Chicken. But they didn't ask kitchen to make my beefsteak again after wrongly remove it from pending list. They let me wait for 20 minutes and only found out their second mistake after I asked the restaurant manager to check one more time. The only plus of the meal was their drinks.\nVery bad service in such quality-oriented place like Takashimaya.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 30, 2016",
